# Keep the build context to sources only. Two of these are load-bearing:
# env files must never enter an image layer, and host build output /
# node_modules would both bloat the context and poison layer caching.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
.git
logs
**/*.log
deploy
docs
.github
.claude
.agents
*.md
